# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored). Everything here is optional: the app runs with none of it.

# Your own RPCs per chain ID, comma-separated, tried before the public ones: the main fix for slow loads and
# public-RPC rate limits. They are baked into the bundle at build time, so never put a secret key here if you will
# share your build (use Settings > RPC endpoints instead, or .env.development.local, which only applies to pnpm dev).
# Supported IDs: 1 (Ethereum), 8453 (Base), 42161 (Arbitrum), 10 (Optimism), 57073 (Ink), 143 (Monad).
# VITE_RPC_URLS_1=https://eth-mainnet.example/v2/your-key
# VITE_RPC_URLS_8453=https://base-mainnet.example/v2/your-key

# Fork tests and maintainer scripts only (never bundled). Must serve historical state (archive).
# FORK_RPC_URL_1=https://...
# FORK_RPC_URL_8453=https://...

# Build metadata, for builds from a source archive without git: the commit shown in the footer.
# APP_COMMIT=v0.1.0-0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567
